{"2274340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Colossal Cave VR", "steam_appid": 2274340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/72b01d3c089b7b0a7260aa7ff520e515.poster.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/72b01d3c089b7b0a7260aa7ff520e515.webm?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/72b01d3c089b7b0a7260aa7ff520e515.mp4?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal Cave 3D is a classic, <strong>cozy VR Adventure</strong>; slow down, explore a massive magical, <i>labyrinthine</i> cave system, all while solving clever, sprawling puzzles at your own pace. Auto-magic maps, limited inventory, all the fantastic creatures and a deep mystery at the heart of the experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>may</i> hear its heart beating while approaching the volcano. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/58f11ab5ec86dde33ac6ffe7506b75d4.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person POV VR</strong> with <strong>classic point-&amp;-click controls</strong>: walk, look, interact, pick things up, and test your theories. <strong>Limited inventory</strong> requires clever management in its own right. A <strong>magical series of maps</strong> quietly track where you’ve been, marking where you’ve dropped items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply focus on solving puzzles instead of wrestling with navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/5220cef8637242a11e89c8821fcedcdd.poster.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/5220cef8637242a11e89c8821fcedcdd.webm?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/5220cef8637242a11e89c8821fcedcdd.mp4?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/36efee7d8136ae4102e17e7246b3af45.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1249 height=145 /></span>This is not a frantic action game; no frenetic timers shouting at you, no combo meters to maintain—just you, your lamp, and a series of intertwined, sprawling, twisty corridors full of brainy, logic-driven challenges.<br><br>Take your time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try weird solutions. Trial and error can be your friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double back to old rooms with new ideas and unlock potential new discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow that “what if I…?” inclination and see what the cave passes back.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/ce90eeae6dc51d8db9f2d7f8454fe828.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is quiet, but not without your footsteps.<br><br>You’ll bump into:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mischievous dwarves with sharp daggers and sharper tempers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grumpy, red bridge guarding troll.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noticeably absent giant.  You see that?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flickering hinkypunks and other odd cave-dwellers. A handsome pirate, perhaps?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasures, strange artifacts, and places that feel just a little <i>too</i> magical to be natural.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/f55089f4c6b8a584f22fdb3ff667df0a.poster.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/f55089f4c6b8a584f22fdb3ff667df0a.webm?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/f55089f4c6b8a584f22fdb3ff667df0a.mp4?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounters are charming, whilst others are just dangerous enough to keep you on your toes—but it all stays firmly in “casual mystical adventure,” not horror. Just fantasy with a slice of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That said, all good Adventures suggest one should <strong>save early, save often</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/78bbf8361a248df1854612c105bac165.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1249 height=145 /></span>Colossal Cave VR leans into that <strong>old-school adventure game</strong> atmosphere: colorful environments, shadowy silhouettes, bats, and a focus on exploring the world for clues rather than being led by the nose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/e3fa7865a3b8f864a30dc4730e1878f6.poster.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/e3fa7865a3b8f864a30dc4730e1878f6.webm?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/e3fa7865a3b8f864a30dc4730e1878f6.mp4?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lack of customization allows dialing the game to match your vibe with a variety of options, including comfort tweaks and settings.  Snap turns, or nuke the narrator.  It's all there. Play exactly how you like—curled up with a headset and <i>slowly</i> dawdle through the cave one cavern at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/3944cbee735f5c81268933de4b005cdf.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed, point-&amp;-click exploration in a massive cave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory that makes item choices and puzzle routes matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handy auto-map that shows where you’ve been and where you dropped items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of dwarves, elves, hinkypunks, and other quirky cave creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of logic-driven puzzles with satisfying “aha!” moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-cool adventure vibes inspired by classic games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible customization options so you can make the adventure as meditative and away as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mythic, mellow <i><strong>cavecation</strong></i>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture down into Colossal Cave, follow your curiosity, and see how far your lamp — <i>and your wits</i> — can take you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/72b01d3c089b7b0a7260aa7ff520e515.poster.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/72b01d3c089b7b0a7260aa7ff520e515.webm?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/72b01d3c089b7b0a7260aa7ff520e515.mp4?t=1783465345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal Cave 3D is a classic, <strong>cozy VR Adventure</strong>; slow down, explore a massive magical, <i>labyrinthine</i> cave system, all while solving clever, sprawling puzzles at your own pace. Auto-magic maps, limited inventory, all the fantastic creatures and a deep mystery at the heart of the experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>may</i> hear its heart beating while approaching the volcano. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/extras/58f11ab5ec86dde33ac6ffe7506b75d4.avif?t=1783465345\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person POV VR</strong> with <strong>classic point-&amp;-click controls</strong>: walk, look, interact, pick things up, and test your theories. <strong>Limited inventory</strong> requires clever management in its own right. A <strong>magical series of maps</strong> quietly track where you’ve been, marking where you’ve dropped items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply focus on solving puzzles instead of wrestling with navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><