llow your curiosity, and see how far your lamp — <i>and your wits</i> — can take you.</p>", "short_description": "Acclaimed game designer Roberta Williams revives Colossal Cave as a retro, point-&amp;-click, cave exploration puzzler. Based on the original 1970’s design by Will Crowther &amp; Don Woods this VR update maintains its vintage charm, while revitalizing it for modern gamers.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Italian, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“... it remains as enjoyable now as it was during those initial years after its release.”<br>8/10 – Worth Playing<br><br>“Colossal Cave is an interesting homage, clearly made with love and respect ...”<br>4/5 – Softpedia<br><br>“... a fascinating game, and this modern remake brings the wonder of a text adventure to life in full 3D.”<br>80/100 – Gaming Trend<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/8732c32067a304fc2444a66f4770dcff96bbd6d0/header.jpg?t=1783465345", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/183c5e0913f37bd007ae6954b8747e339c2acabb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783465345", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274340/183c5e0913f37bd007ae6954b8747e339c2acabb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783465345", "website": "https://www.colossalcave3d.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970, AMD Radeon R9 290 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB av